# The Bulma bundle is vendored by `go generate ./...` rather than committed, so
# these two paths are build output. theme/bulma/bulma.lock is the committed
# record of which release and which digests `go generate` expects, and is what
# makes a regenerated bundle verifiable rather than merely present.
#
# The package still compiles without them because theme/bulma/static/js is
# committed alongside, and `go:embed` has something real to embed. That matters:
# the alternative is a build error in a package nobody touched, reported instead
# of the test that says "run go generate".
theme/bulma/static/css/bulma.min.css
theme/bulma/static/css/LICENSE
